I see where I went wrong now.  

The slope (filling rate) is  

\[
\text{slope}=\frac{\Delta\text{water level}}{\Delta\text{time}}
          =\frac{18\text{ in} - 10\text{ in}}{20\text{ min} - 3\text{ min}}
          =\frac{8\text{ in}}{17\text{ min}}
